{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Su6ESeMk5m1793706751.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國中期選舉投票展開。</p><p></p><p>紐約州、緬因州和弗吉尼亞州等，東部一些州的投票站已經開放。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.VOTE-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KRFsTLbGdC1793706761.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>今次中期選舉，將改選眾議院全部435席，參議院100席中的35席。另外，美國50個州有36個會選州長。預計部分州的票站，最快本港時間明早有結果。</p><p></p><p>選前民調預測，共和黨可能失去國會眾議院控制權。總統特朗普再次指民主黨試圖在阿拉斯加州「鎅票」是詐騙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:42:16.732338+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:20.443607+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:28.386619+00:00","content_hash":"51afce22e6f3d504ddffea41a4ba2b13b12dacc5206c9c220d620d2142bd9500","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:42:16.732338+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}